|------------------------|-------------|-------------|-------------|
| Operating Activities | $2.9M | $4.8M | $12.0M |
| Investing Activities | ($4.5M) | ($6.6M) | ($8.7M) |
| Financing Activities | $23.9M | $43.8M | $83.7M |
| **Net Change in Cash** | **$22.3M** | **$42.0M** | **$87.0M** |

