## Risk Factors and Outlook

### Key Risks

The Company faces several key risks, including intense competition in the business intelligence and analytics market, the need to continue innovating to maintain our competitive position, and the challenge of achieving profitability while continuing to invest in growth. Additionally, macroeconomic conditions and potential downturns in customer spending could impact our revenue growth.

### Outlook for FY 2026

We are optimistic about our prospects for FY 2026. We expect to achieve revenue of approximately $125 million, representing 43% year-over-year growth. We plan to continue investing in product development and go-to-market activities, while also focusing on improving our path to profitability. We expect to expand our team to approximately 750 employees by the end of FY 2026.

---

## Conclusion

NexaTech Solutions has made significant progress over the past three years, growing revenue, expanding our customer base, and strengthening our balance sheet. While we have not yet achieved profitability, we are on a clear path toward sustainable, profitable growth. We remain committed to our mission of empowering organizations with intelligent data analytics solutions and to delivering value to our customers, employees, and shareholders.

